952 0 obj
<<
/Title (Forming a Virginia entity requires different paperwork, requiring Articles of Organization for corporations or Articles of Incorporation for LLCs. The governing law is also different. For newly formed Virginia entities, the business is completely governed by Virginia state laws. For foreign entities, internal affairs like voting rights and shareholder relations are governed by your home state while following Virginia state laws for in-state business affairs. If anyone were to sue a foreign entity for anything but Virginia related misconduct, the case would follow home state laws rather than VA laws.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 957 0 R
/Next 945 0 R
>>
endobj
